    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">taphachuu qofa lakkaaʼi</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">istaatistikaan yeroo walqabatee ture osoo hin taʼin yeroo sagaleen dhugumatti taphachaa ture lakkaaʼa. yeroon hordoffii balʼaan banaa taʼee galmaaʼe qofti taphachuu safare; kaan hafa.</string>
